## Pro Tip Section
# Pro Tip: If you ever really need separate keys, Since the UI button is gone, the "Professional" way to generate new keys in the future is via the command line on your ops-center machine:
# 1. SSH into your ops-center machine
# 2. Run the following command:
# Example command (You don't need to run this now)
# '''docker exec -it minio mc admin user svcacct add myminio admin '''
# Or, if you are not using Docker run the following command directly:
#    opscenter-admin-setup --generate-keys
# Follow the prompts to create new access and secret keys.   

